## 3. Hardcoded secrets in tests — → FIXED
All test credentials are centralized in `backend/tests/_creds.py`, sourced from env
vars (TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD, etc.) with non-production local fallbacks. Individual test
files import from `_creds` instead of hardcoding. conftest fixtures also read `_creds`.
Override in CI via env vars. (Files previously flagged: test_iter170_admin_audit.py,
test_iter171_nearby_businesses.py, test_service_categories_home.py — now use `_creds`.)

